{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "89b5b3e7-c827-8e0a-9a28-81999f158bbc",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:05:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I think I have the wrong number. I was trying to reach the building inspector's office, and I got this one off an old flyer. Which, honestly, people should stop keeping those on bulletin boards."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that happens a lot, hon. You've reached the City Clerk. Inspections is a different office, but I can send you over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, the number on the flyer has a different area code than mine. It's 508, I think? Or is that Massachusetts? I never know which is which. It's silly to have two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one is Rhode Island, that's us. Five-oh-eight is Massachusetts, so an old flyer might have had a number from over the line. Doesn't matter now, you're in the right state at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, because I'm a property manager and I deal with this stuff all day. Anyway, the neighbor across the street from one of my buildings just got a new doorbell, and it is very loud. Wicked loud, honestly. Nobody needs that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, a doorbell like that is probably not a city matter, but if you have a question about the building itself, inspections can tell you. Let me transfer you. If it drops, the main city line will get you there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll stay on. My number is 401-555-0154 in case it cuts out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, zero-one-five-four. Hang on one second, I'll put you through now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Sandra. Appreciate it."
    }
  ],
